  "description": "Prussian strongman Eugen Sandow performs a sequence of bodybuilding poses in Thomas Edison's Black Maria studio in West Orange, New Jersey, filmed by William K. L. Dickson in May 1894. High-contrast full-figure framing against a plain dark backdrop makes this a canonical test clip for pose estimation, foreground segmentation, and body-zone mapping.",
